{"channelId":"UCAO-aTpPzdLZN4aLSE-KnnA","row":["Exotic Pet Vet TV Show",9290,"The new animal web series Exotic Pet Vet brings you through the exam room door and into the colorful and chaotic world of Dr. Dan and his colleagues Dr. Leo and Dr. E. Our cameras are there to capture the revolving door of unusual animals with strange ailments that visit this specialized veterinarian practice on a daily basis.\n\nEach episode features real life scenarios that are followed from diagnosis through treatment with actual care tips and specific medical information vital to exotic pet owners. Some of these medical procedures are shown for the first time ever on television.  Also presented are interesting facts about each animal, footage of the pets in their home habitats and interviews with the owners.\n\nWhether you have an exotic pet, or you're just fascinated by rare animal species, the Exotic Pet Vet Series illustrates the joys (and challenges) of owning some of the cutest and most interesting creatures on earth.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCAO-aTpPzdLZN4aLSE-KnnA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCAO-aTpPzdLZN4aLSE-KnnA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:03:11.294Z","channelId":"UCAO-aTpPzdLZN4aLSE-KnnA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"402ffd54be1e369cdb271656a7ddd28bc9685a40d277acb5b3151e16bfffed27","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"92290bd355fa95ea724104cd45ca5624bf5528e620df34953d4c241fab7fa2dc"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCAO-aTpPzdLZN4aLSE-KnnA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":9290,"raw":"9.29K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCAO-aTpPzdLZN4aLSE-KnnA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:03:11.294Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"veterinary","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","